uutils findutils is a cross-platform reimplementation of the GNU find
utilities in Rust.

This package installs the same file names as misc/findutils:
${PREFIX}/bin/gfind, ${PREFIX}/bin/gxargs, ${PREFIX}/bin/glocate and
${PREFIX}/bin/gupdatedb.  It therefore conflicts with misc/findutils
and declares it as a secondary pkgpath, so the package tools accept it
as a provider of that path.  The GNU package must not be installed at
the same time.

Unlike the GNU port, there is no ${PREFIX}/libexec/gfrcode helper, and
gupdatedb(1) is a native binary rather than the GNU shell script.
